WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.634
-We are so happy
to have Fred Armisen

00:00:02.634 --> 00:00:03.734
back with us all week.

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:05.167
How you doing, Fred?
-Great.

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.868
-Fred, I'm always amazed
that you have time

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:09.400
not just to lead this band

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.167
and be an actor
and a comedian and musician,

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.367
but also all these
other side projects.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:15.601
And I was thrilled to hear

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:19.033
that you are starting
your own food truck.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:20.467
-I am.
-That's so great.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:23.400
-I'm so happy about it.
So...

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.701
-I can tell
you're happy about it.

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:26.033
-Yeah, I'm so glad.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.033
-Sometimes I can tell
when you're being insincere,

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:30.100
but I feel the happiness
is just --

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.801
-It's called
the Jingle Bells food truck.

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:35.334
-Okay.
-And so we just have, like --

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:37.300
It's like a lot
of jingling bells,

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.901
you know,
like the classic Christmas --

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.801
-Gotcha, so when the truck
moves, it's pretty loud?

00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:43.200
-It's pretty loud. Yeah.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.000
And then when we arrive at,
you know, a site,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.033
we'll just, you know,
ring those bells some more.

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:50.968
And there's no, like,
food, per se,

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:55.300
but it's more of the sort of act
of having a food truck,

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.300
because I think what people like
is the actual vehicle...

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.334
-Oh, funny.
-...and sort of coming around.

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:02.834
-See, I'm gonna take
the other side of this.

00:01:02.834 --> 00:01:05.200
I think people like
the food the most.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.634
-Oh.
-Yeah.

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:08.667
Like, I think when you think
about, "Oh, you want to go --"

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:09.834
I think if a friend
of mine said,

00:01:09.834 --> 00:01:12.000
"You want to go
to this new food truck?"

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.400
I'd be pretty bummed
if it was just a truck.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.067
-Interesting. Okay.
-Yeah.

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:21.067
-I mean, what do you do --
Like, you still walk

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:22.234
to the truck anyway, don't you?

00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:23.734
Like, you walk to food trucks.

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.734
-I would walk to the truck
with the expectation

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:27.267
that there would be food.

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:32.300
-But if -- Not as an argument,
but if you heard bells,

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:36.067
right, if you heard
jingle bells, you would go.

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:39.067
-I would -- Yes, I would go.
-You would go.

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:41.234
-But then I would be angry
when I got there.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.033
That's the part --
I feel like you're thinking

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:44.901
all the way up to the moment.

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:46.968
Everything would be
happy anticipation.

00:01:46.968 --> 00:01:48.601
I'm hearing bells.
I see a food truck.

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:49.868
I walk over.

00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:52.234
Yes, we are on the same page
up to that moment.

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:54.567
-Yes, but --
-Now we get up there

00:01:54.567 --> 00:01:56.701
and I look in --
I'm assuming there's a door,

00:01:56.701 --> 00:01:58.934
like the window you lean in
to see what the food is.

00:01:58.934 --> 00:02:01.100
-Yeah, but we don't
live in that moment.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.734
We live in the moment before.
We're not in that business.

00:02:03.734 --> 00:02:05.167
It's the moment before.

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:06.901
-You say, "We're not
in that business."

00:02:06.901 --> 00:02:08.434
I don't know
what the business is.

00:02:08.434 --> 00:02:09.701
-It's a food truck.

00:02:09.701 --> 00:02:11.634
-No, it's not a food --

00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:13.434
-It is.

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:14.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.934
-Give it up for Fred Armisen,
everybody.

00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:18.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

